    "## Class 02: Show It (Printing Output) 🖨️\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "Last class, we made Python calculate things:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "2 + 2\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Python happily gave us:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "4\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "But what if we want Python to **show a message**?\n",
    "\n",
    "For that, we use the `print()` function."
   ],
   "id": "1687680e78c10c15"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "code",
   "outputs": [],
   "execution_count": null,
